  be 40 minutes long at Schiller Park in German Village (we will meet in 
 the parking lot at the southeast corner). You can expect 20-30 digital p
 hotos to be delivered to you via password-protected online album within 
 one week of the shoot. \n\nPlease type your full name below\, click whic
 h date/time works for you\, and hit "send."\n\nWithin 24 hours of bookin
 g your date/time\, I will send you an email invoice that will be due wit
 hin 48 hours to hold your spot. So looking forward to seeing you soon! :
 )\n
