SUMMARY:SEAoO Student Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Our first club meeting is Monday the 28th at 6pm at Donatos o
 n High Street.  We're planning on keeping the first meeting short and sw
 eet: introducing ourselves\, the club\, our goals\, get to know the pros
 pective members and actually get into the meat of structural engineering
  during the second meeting.  You're welcome to come if you're available/
 interested in coming or having a meeting with all the officers before th
 en. We're trying to figure out a time that is good for all of us so let 
 me know if you're interested in either one so we can try to workout a da
 y/time. If not\, that's totally fine\; I understand it's last minute nor
  your responsibility--I just wanted to keep you in the loop.
