 t has supported me during the training\, through donations\, and cheerin
 g me on at Pelotonia '17!  I am thankful to be surrounded by such great 
 family\, friends\, and community.\n\nPelotonia '18 goals:\n- Ride 180 mi
 les\n- Commit to being a High Roller\n- Contribute 0.025% of overall fun
 draising\n- Help provide a cancer-free world for our children\n- Officia
 l training starts 12/1/0217 :)
