DESCRIPTION:The Structural department event will be held at Topgolf Colum
 bus <https://topgolf.com/us/columbus/> . Come hang out\, have a drink\, 
 eat some food\, and take a swing. There is no pressure to be good\, just
  a great time for all. \n\n \n\nExpect to arrive 15 minutes early. Food\
 , drinks\, and game will be provided. \n\n \n\nPlease respond to this in
 vitation so that appropriate accommodations can be made. Thank you.
