DESCRIPTION:Justin\,\n\n \n\nI assume you have access to a car\, so let’s
  pick something in Grandview.  \n\n \n\nA few options are:\n\n*	Mazah Me
 diterranean Eatery\n*	Grandview Café\n*	Matt the Miller’s\n*	AAB India R
 estaurant\n*	Aladdin’s Eatery\n*	Red Hook Grill\n\n \n\nLet me know if a
 ny of those sound good or if you have any other suggestions.  I am flexi
 ble.\n\n \n\nI am looking forward to talking further with you!\n\n \n\nT
 hanks\,\n\n \n\nBernie Kooi PE\, SE\, LEED AP\nStructural Engineer\n\n\n
 1650 Watermark Dr\, Columbus\, Ohio USA 43215\nT +1 (614) 487 1650      
