 Kooi <Bernie.Kooi@korda.com <mailto:Bernie.Kooi@korda.com> >\nSent: Wedn
 esday\, July 17\, 2019 10:52 AM\nTo: Brenner\, Justin N.\nSubject: RE: P
 ossible Meetup at Korda \n\n \n\nJustin\,\n\n \n\nTime is flying by and 
 summer is going to be over before you know it.  Thank you for reaching b
 ack out to me.\n\n \n\nI think it would be great to meet again in person
  and discuss Korda\, internship\, and potential future opportunities.  I
  will actually be out of the office starting August 15 thought September
  3\, how about we meet the September 9 – 13?  We work half days on Frida
 y so we could meet for lunch if that works for your schedule.\n\n \n\nLe
 t me know and I look forward to continuing the conversation.\n\n \n\nTha
 nks\,\n\n \n\nBernie Kooi PE\, SE\, LEED AP\nStructural Engineer\n\n\n16
 50 Watermark Dr\, Columbus\, Ohio USA 43215\nT +1 (614) 487 1650       \
