 nTo: Bernie Kooi <Bernie.Kooi@korda.com <mailto:Bernie.Kooi@korda.com> >
 \nSubject: Possible Meetup at Korda\n\n \n\nHi Bernie\,\n\n \n\nTime’s b
 een flying by this summer. I’m already a month out from wrapping up my i
 nternship at Honda and a year from graduating from OSU’s Civil Engineeri
 ng program.\n\n \n\nI was wondering if I would be able to come into Kord
 a during the work week (post August 12th) to learn more about your engin
 eering services and community? We could also discuss plans with the SEAO
 O club\, and cover future opportunities during the school year as well a
 s post graduation. What day might work for you?\n\n \n\nThank you\,\n\n 
