BEGIN:VEVENT
CREATED:20230227T021046Z
DESCRIPTION:_____________________________________________\nFrom: Jon Murp
 hy <jonmurphy987@gmail.com>\nSent: Tuesday\, February 14\, 2023 10:33 AM
 \nTo: Bernie Kooi <Bernie@kooi-se.com>\nSubject: Re: Coffee\, lunch\, or
  beer?\n\nSure\, we can do 6. We will plan to see you on 3/2 at 6 p.m. a
 t Nomad!\n\n\nOn Tue\, Feb 14\, 2023 at 9:17 AM Bernie Kooi <Bernie@kooi
 -se.com<mailto:Bernie@kooi-se.com>> wrote:\nAny chance it could be easie
 r\, say 6?  The kids start their bedtime routine around 8.\n\n[cid:image
 001.png@01D9407D.41A5B9D0]<http://www.kooi-se.com/>\nBernie Kooi PE\, SE
 \, LEED AP\nStructural Engineer | Owner\n\n900 Foxcreek Road\, Sunbury\,
  OH 43074\nE: bernie@kooi-se.com<mailto:bernie@kooi-se.com>  P: 614.218.
 1607\nwww.kooi-se.com<http://www.kooi-se.com/>\n\n[cid:image002.png@01D9
 407D.41A5B9D0]<https://www.linkedin.com/in/berniekooi/>\n\nFrom: Jon Mur
 phy <jonmurphy987@gmail.com<mailto:jonmurphy987@gmail.com>>\nSent: Monda
 y\, February 13\, 2023 10:35 PM\nTo: Bernie Kooi <Bernie@kooi-se.com<mai
 lto:Bernie@kooi-se.com>>\nSubject: Re: Coffee\, lunch\, or beer?\n\nNoma
 d sounds good -- how does 7pm work for you guys?\n\nOn Sun\, Feb 12\, 20
 23 at 9:50 AM Bernie Kooi <Bernie@kooi-se.com<mailto:Bernie@kooi-se.com>
 > wrote:\nJon\,\n\nThursday 3/2 would work for us.  Let’s pick a place o
 n Polaris (Nomad is good) or somewhere around there.\n\nLet me know if t
 hat works\n\nThanks\,\n\nBernie Kooi PE\, SE\, LEED AP\nStructural Engin
 eer | Owner\n\n900 Foxcreek Road\, Sunbury\, OH 43074\nE: bernie@kooi-se
 .com<mailto:bernie@kooi-se.com>  P: 614.218.1607\nwww.kooi-se.com<http:/
 /www.kooi-se.com/>\n________________________________\nFrom: Jon Murphy <
 jonmurphy987@gmail.com<mailto:jonmurphy987@gmail.com>>\nSent: Friday\, F
 ebruary 10\, 2023 12:33:21 PM\nTo: Bernie Kooi <Bernie@kooi-se.com<mailt
 o:Bernie@kooi-se.com>>\nSubject: Re: Coffee\, lunch\, or beer?\n\nSounds
  good\, let's make it a double date! How does March 2 or March 5 work fo
 r you guys? We could do drinks and/or dinner?\n\nOn Fri\, Feb 10\, 2023 
 at 11:24 AM Bernie Kooi <Bernie@kooi-se.com<mailto:Bernie@kooi-se.com>> 
 wrote:\n\nJon\,\n\n\n\nGood to hear from you.\n\nI did receive the email
  to the other account as well but this account I do check more often.\n\
 n\n\nThat is exciting to hear that you are contemplating the shift.  It 
 would be more than happy to share my preparation\, experience\, and how 
 things are going so far.  If you’re ready for a rollercoaster that goes 
 up/down/left/right all at the same time\, then you’ll be fine 😊\n\n\n\n
 Let’s put something on the book for 2-3 weeks out if that works for you.
   Perhaps it can involve our better halves and get a more holistic pictu
 re of things?\n\n\n\nTake care\,\n\n\n\n[cid:image001.png@01D9407D.41A5B
 9D0]<http://www.kooi-se.com/>\n\nBernie Kooi PE\, SE\, LEED AP\nStructur
 al Engineer | Owner\n\n900 Foxcreek Road\, Sunbury\, OH 43074\nE: bernie
 @kooi-se.com<mailto:bernie@kooi-se.com>  P: 614.218.1607\nwww.kooi-se.co
 m<http://www.kooi-se.com/>\n\n[cid:image002.png@01D9407D.41A5B9D0]<https
 ://www.linkedin.com/in/berniekooi/>\n\n\n\nFrom: Jon Murphy <jonmurphy98
 7@gmail.com<mailto:jonmurphy987@gmail.com>>\nSent: Friday\, February 10\
 , 2023 9:35 AM\nTo: Bernie Kooi <Bernie@kooi-se.com<mailto:Bernie@kooi-s
 e.com>>\nSubject: Fwd: Coffee\, lunch\, or beer?\n\n\n\nHi Bernie -- see
  below\, Megan just gave me your new email address\, I may have used an 
 old old below. Hope all is well!\n\n\n\n---------- Forwarded message ---
 ------\nFrom: Jon Murphy <jonmurphy987@gmail.com<mailto:jonmurphy987@gma
 il.com>>\nDate: Fri\, Feb 10\, 2023 at 9:13 AM\nSubject: Coffee\, lunch\
 , or beer?\nTo: <berniekooi@hotmail.com<mailto:berniekooi@hotmail.com>>\
 n\n\n\nHi Bernie\,\n\n\n\nI hope all is well with you. Megan filled me i
 n on how you've started your own business. Congrats! I'm in the very ear
 ly stages of contemplating the pros and cons of a similar move\, and tho
 ught you'd be a good person to talk to about it. I know we're in entirel
 y different industries but I'm sure the leap is somewhat similar in many
  ways.\n\n\n\nLet me know if you're interested and able to get together 
 for coffee\, lunch or a beer sometime in the next few weeks. No rush\, a
 s I know you have a business to run!\n\n\n\nTake care\,\n\n\n\nJon
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230302T193000
DTSTAMP:20230302T225513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230302T180000
LAST-MODIFIED:20230302T225511Z
LOCATION:Nomad Hot Kitchen x Cool Spirits (2050 Polaris Pkwy\, Columbus\,
  OH  43240)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Coffee\, lunch\, or beer? - nope! Dinner.
